<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="5"><b>Review - Robot Arena</b></font><br><br>
<table width="100%" border="0">
	<tr>
		<td colspan="2"><font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="4">Have you ever wanted to participate in the Robot wars that you see on Cable?  Here’s your chance.</font><BR></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top"><img src='/images/Pics_boxes/2351.jpg' border='2' align='left'></td>
		<td valign="top" width="100%">
			<table border="0">
				<tr>
					<td colspan="2">
						<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="2">
						<font face='verdana,arial,helvetica' size='2'>Developer: <a HREF='http://www.gabrielinteractive.com/' target='_new'><font size="2">Gabriel Interactive Inc.</a><BR>
